sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Core as core-api
    participant S1 as document-type-identification
    participant S2 as template-identification
    participant S3 as metadata-validation
    participant S4 as read-data
    participant DB as Database

    Core->>DB: Bootstrap document + parent/link rows

    Core->>S1: file_base64
    S1-->>Core: document_type, confidence

    Core->>S2: file_base64, document_type
    S2-->>Core: template, confidence

    Core->>S3: file_base64, document_type, template
    S3-->>Core: status, message_code, checks

    Core->>S4: file_base64, document_type, template
    S4-->>Core: status, trust_level, fields, raw_ocr, normalized_data

    Core->>DB: Persist OCR + extracted business data